__pycache__/
*.pyc
/build/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
/dist/

# Internal build/test notes -- not part of what a player installs.
NAESTE_TEST.md
docs/RELEASES.md

# Our own build machinery: manifest audits, plugin builder, gates.
# The plugins themselves are on the releases page.
tools/
docs/EXTENSIONS.md
catalog/GROUP_*.md
catalog/pc_build_report.json

# Harvested research lists. These are how WE find games; they are not how a
# player installs one, and the launcher never reads them. They also carry a
# link to every world author's repository, which is a standing invitation to
# the request PinkSwitch had to make twice. Kept locally, published nowhere.
catalog/games.json
catalog/index.json
catalog/gamelist_raw.txt

# More harvested research, same reasoning as the block above: these are how WE
# decide what to build, they carry every world author's repository address, and
# no player or launcher ever reads them.
catalog/sheet_survey.json
catalog/sheet_links.json
catalog/guide_platform.json
catalog/content.json

# The removal list. Publishing it would name the people who asked to be left
# alone and list the work they asked us to drop -- the exact opposite of what
# honouring the request means. It is gate input, and the gate lives in tools/.
catalog/removed.json

# Proof harnesses for the bridges: our gates, not anything a player installs.
# No other extension ships one either.
extensions/*/proof/

# Vores research-grundlag: biblioteker, salgstal, speedrun-data og
# randomiser-vurderinger for 2.252 spil. Det er hvordan VI beslutter hvad der
# skal bygges - ikke noget en spiller installerer, og det bringer de samme
# forfatter-adresser med sig som blokken ovenfor. Ligger lokalt, publiceres
# ingen steder.
research/
